#: temp.glade:1949
msgid "Primary DBL site"
msgstr "Namba wan DBL site"

#: temp.glade:1955
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles available\n"
"at the Digital Bible Library website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication. You must log in\n"
"to the site in order to access resources.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Gat handet scripture bundle long\n"
"Digital Bible Library website we yu ken\n"
"daunlodim na usim long wanpela pablikesen. Yu mas login\n"
"long site pastaim bai yu ken kisim ol risos.\n"
"\n"
"Usim ol risos i gat tekst\n"
"(i no audio tasol) na i gutpela yu makim\n"
"USX daunlod opsen.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: Sapos dispela opsen i no wok, em\n"
"bilong opsen \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"em i stap long General sekson\n"
"bilong Advanced tab.</span>"

#: temp.glade:1982
msgid "If you don't already have a Scripture Text Bundle, \n"
"then you can download a USX or USFM text\n"
"bundle from an online scripture repository."
msgstr "Sapos yu no gat Scripture Text Bundle yet, \n"
"yu ken daunlodim wanpela USX o USFM tekst\n"
"bundle long wanpela onlain Skripsa ripositori."

#: temp.glade:1987
msgid "<b>Step 1</b>\n"
"Download a Scripture\n"
"Text Bundle from an\n"
"Online Repository"
msgstr "<b>Step 1</b>\n"
"Daunlodim Scripture\n"
"Text Bundle long\n"
"Onlain Ripositori"

#: temp.glade:2005 temp.glade:5025 temp.glade:16383
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "Diskripsen:"

#: temp.glade:2018
msgid "Open.Bible site"
msgstr "Open.Bible site"

#: temp.glade:2024
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles\n"
"at the Open.Bible website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Gat handet scripture bundle long\n"
"Open.Bible website we yu ken\n"
"daunlodim na usim long wanpela pablikesen.\n"
"\n"
"Usim ol risos i gat tekst\n"
"(i no audio tasol) na i gutpela yu makim\n"
"USX daunlod opsen.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: Sapos dispela opsen i no wok, em\n"
"bilong opsen \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"em i stap long General sekson\n"
"bilong Advanced tab.</span>"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkpolyglot.py:1113 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4797 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4822 temp.glade:2055 temp.glade:2280
msgid "Do not use spaces or special characters"
msgstr "No ken usim spes o spesel karakta"

#: temp.glade:2099
msgid "PTXprint is built with Python & PyGTK3, using Glade for\n"
"the user-interface. The PDFs are produced by enhanced \n"
"XeTeX macros (ptx2pdf) with a long and reliable history."
msgstr "PTXprint i wok long Python & PyGTK3, na i usim Glade bilong\n"
"user-interface. Ol PDF i kamap long ol gutpela \n"
"XeTeX makro (ptx2pdf) i gat longpela na tru stori bilong wok."

#: temp.glade:2103
msgid "PTXprint Homepage"
msgstr "Homepej bilong PTXprint"

#: temp.glade:2143
msgid "PTXprint: Save Current Configuration As..."
msgstr "PTXprint: Seivim Configuration Nau Olsem..."

#: temp.glade:2224 temp.glade:2246 temp.glade:3995 temp.glade:4018
msgid "Enter a name for the configuration to be saved.\n"
"\n"
"Note that only Roman/Latin names\n"
"are supported using: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"parentheses, underscores and hyphens.\n"
"Spaces are not permitted."
msgstr "Putim wanpela nem bilong configuration yu laik seivim.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem ol Roman/Latin nem tasol\n"
"i ken: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"ol parentesis, anda-lain na haifen.\n"
"Spes i no ken."

#: temp.glade:2230
msgid "Configuration Name:"
msgstr "Nem bilong Configuration:"

#: temp.glade:2308 temp.glade:2353
msgid "PTXprint: Please Confirm..."
msgstr "PTXprint: Plis Kamapim Tru..."

#: temp.glade:2313
msgid "You are about to REMOVE this Configuration"
msgstr "Yu laik RAUSIM dispela Configuration"

#: temp.glade:2314
msgid "Are you sure you want to DELETE it?"
msgstr "Yu stap tru long RAUSIM em?"

#: temp.glade:2318 temp.glade:17154
msgid "Delete this Saved Configuration\n"
"\n"
"This also deletes the corresponding subfolder \n"
"of temporary files in the local\\ptxprint folder \n"
"but does not delete the previously created \n"
"PDF files which will remain in that folder."
msgstr "Rausim dispela Configuration i Seiv pinis\n"
"\n"
"Dispela i rausim tu sabfolder bilong\n"
"ol tempori fail long local\\ptxprint folder\n"
"tasol i no rausim ol PDF fail yu mekim pinis,\n"
"ol i bai stap yet long dispela folder."

#: temp.glade:2358
msgid "You are about to CREATE a diglot (or polyglot) configuration. This setting cannot be undone."
msgstr "Yu laik KAMAPIM wanpela diglot (o polyglot) konfigureisen. Dispela seting i no inap i go bek."

#: temp.glade:2359
msgid "Consider using the <b>Save As...</b> button to create a NEW Configuration Layout before proceeding to enable the Diglot. <b>Are you sure you want to CONTINUE?</b>"
msgstr "Tingim long yusim boton <b>Save As...</b> long kamapim NIU Configuration Layout paslain yu go het long op'nim Diglot. <b>Yu olsem yu laik KIRAP LONG DISPELA?</b>"

#: temp.glade:2364
msgid "Unlike most other PTXprint settings (which can easily be\n"
"toggled on or off), the Diglot setting is special in that it\n"
"has to set up a number of other settings; and is very hard\n"
"to disable later. So only continue if you are sure that this\n"
"is what you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"It is highly recommended to first save the existing\n"
"configuration with a new name (like \"Diglot\") and\n"
"then proceed with the step of enabling this option.\n"
msgstr "Narapela seting bilong PTXprint (ol i isi long opim o pasim)\n"
"i narapela long Diglot seting. Diglot seting i mas setim\n"
"sampela narapela seting, na i hat tumas long rausim bihain.\n"
"Olsem na go het sapos yu save tru olsem dispela em wok\n"
"yu mas mekim.\n"
"\n"
"I gutpela tumas long seivim paslain configuration i stap\n"
"wantaim nupela nem (olsem \"Diglot\") na bihain yu\n"
"opim dispela opsen.\n"

#: temp.glade:2409
msgid "PTXprint: Generate Front Matter"
msgstr "PTXprint: Kamapim Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:2494
msgid "BASIC: Front matter contains just a few\n"
"essentials with publication information"
msgstr "BASIC: Front matter i gat sampela\n"
"bikpela samting tasol bilong pablikeisen"

#: temp.glade:2500
msgid "This option will create a simple verso page\n"
"containing essential copyright and licensing\n"
"information followed by a table of contents."
msgstr "Dispela opsen bai kamapim wanpela isi verso peij\n"
"i gat copyright na licensing infomeisen\n"
"bilong mas, na bihain wanpela table bilong ol samting insait."

#: temp.glade:2518
msgid "ADVANCED: template contains several sections\n"
"(some of which require editing before use)"
msgstr "ADVANCED: template i gat planti sekson\n"
"(sampela i mas edit paslain long yusim)"

#: temp.glade:2524
msgid "This option will create an extensive template\n"
"with multiple sections (each of which will start\n"
"on a new page in the final publication). You will\n"
"need to edit the sample text provided so that it\n"
"communicates in the required language(s).\n"
"You can also remove unwanted sections if they\n"
"are inappropriate for this publication.\n"
"Note: In order to make this template generic for\n"
"several different publications in this project, you\n"
"are encouraged to use \\zvar|variables\\*  which will be\n"
"replaced with publication-specific info when printed.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|languagename\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|copiesprinted\\*"
msgstr "Dispela opsen bai kamapim wanpela bikpela template\n"
"i gat planti sekson (wanwan i kirap\n"
"long nupela peij long pinis pablikeisen). Yu mas\n"
"edit ol sampel tekst long ol i toktok long\n"
"languis yu laik.\n"
"Yu ken rausim ol sekson yu no laikim sapos\n"
"ol i no stret long dispela pablikeisen.\n"
"Not: Long mekim dispela template i ken wok long\n"
"sampela narapela pablikeisen insait long dispela projek, yu\n"
"kisim tingting long yusim \\zvar|variables\\*  na ol bai\n"
"senis long infomeisen bilong wanwan pablikeisen taim i print.\n"
"Olsem:\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|languagename\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|copiesprinted\\*"

#: temp.glade:2556
msgid "Include sections for a separate cover page"
msgstr "Putim ol sekson bilong narapela kava peij"

#: temp.glade:2561
msgid "(Not yet implemented)\n"
"Enable this option if you want to include the following\n"
"sections (used for creating a cover page):\n"
"\\periph Cover - detailing text and optional picture\n"
"\\periph Spine - text for the spine of the cover"
msgstr "(I no wok yet)\n"
"Opim dispela opsen sapos yu laik putim ol dispela\n"
"sekson (ol i bilong kamapim kava peij):\n"
"\\periph Cover - tekst na wanpela pikja sapos yu laik\n"
"\\periph Spine - tekst bilong spine bilong kava"

#: temp.glade:2597 temp.glade:2970
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr "Lukaut!"

#: temp.glade:2612
msgid "This operation can overwrite\n"
"carefully crafted settings.\n"
"So choose carefully...\n"
"If in doubt, click Cancel."
msgstr "Dispela wok i ken rausim ol seting\n"
"yu bin wokim gut.\n"
"Olsem na makim gut...\n"
"Sapos yu tupela tingting, klikim Cancel."

#: temp.glade:2627
msgid "DIGLOT: template for a Diglot or Polyglot publication\n"
"(deliberately fuller — delete sections you do not need)"
msgstr "DIGLOT: template bilong Diglot o Polyglot pablikeisen\n"
"(i gat planti moa — rausim ol sekson yu no nidim)"

#: temp.glade:2633
msgid "This option creates a DIGLOT / POLYGLOT front matter\n"
"template designed for publications with two (or more)\n"
"languages or scripts. It is deliberately more complete\n"
"than the BASIC and ADVANCED templates because diglots\n"
"are inherently complex: two (or more) texts, often two\n"
"contents lists, two prefaces, sometimes two scripts and\n"
"two writing directions. Delete the sections you do not need.\n"
"\n"
"Like the ADVANCED template it uses \\zvar|variables\\* and\n"
"\\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* markers for column-specific content,\n"
"so it requires editing before use and is NOT suitable for\n"
"use inside Paratext without prior modification.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is disabled, the Diglot setting is not\n"
"enabled for this configuration."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i kamapim wanpela front matter template bilong DIGLOT / POLYGLOT\n"
"bilong ol pablikeisen i gat tupela (o moa)\n"
"languis o skript. I gat planti moa samting\n"
"bilong BASIC na ADVANCED template, long wanem ol diglot\n"
"i hat long wokim: tupela (o moa) tekst, planti taim tupela\n"
"kontens lis, tupela prefas, sampela taim tupela skript na\n"
"tupela rot bilong raitim. Rausim ol sekson yu no nidim.\n"
"\n"
"Olsem ADVANCED template, em i yusim \\zvar|variables\\* na\n"
"\\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* mak bilong ol samting long wanwan kolom,\n"
"olsem na yu mas edit paslain long yusim, na i NO gutpela\n"
"long yusim insait long Paratext sapos yu no senisim paslain.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela opsen i no wok, Diglot seting i no\n"
"opim long dispela konfigureisen."

#: temp.glade:2662
msgid "PARATEXT: Make a copy of the Project's FRT book\n"
"(which may be edited to make use of \\zvar|variables\\*)"
msgstr "PARATEXT: Kopiim FRT buk bilong Projek\n"
"(yu ken edit long yusim \\zvar|variables\\*)"

#: temp.glade:2668
msgid "This option will create a COPY of the Paratext project's\n"
"FRT book to be used exclusively by PTXprint. You can\n"
"edit the front matter to make use of PTXprint-specific\n"
"\\zvar|variables\\* but note that none of these edits will\n"
"be reflected in Paratext. In addition, if you edit the FRT\n"
"book in Paratext, those changes will not be reflected\n"
"here until you regenerate this (local) Front Matter.\n"
"\n"
"If option is disabled, it is due to not having a FRT book\n"
"in the Paratext project (so there is nothing to import)."
msgstr "Dispela opsen bai kamapim wanpela KOPI bilong FRT buk\n"
"bilong Paratext projek, PTXprint tasol i yusim. Yu ken\n"
"edit front matter long yusim ol \\zvar|variables\\* bilong PTXprint,\n"
"tasol ol dispela edit i no inap kamap long Paratext. Na tu, sapos yu edit FRT\n"
"buk long Paratext, ol senis i no kamap\n"
"long hia inap yu kamapim gen dispela Front Matter (bilong hia).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos opsen i no wok, em i bikos i no gat FRT buk\n"
"long Paratext projek (olsem na i no gat samting long kisim)."

#: temp.glade:2719
msgid "Generate Front Matter"
msgstr "Kamapim Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:2740
msgid "PTXprint: Generate PicList"
msgstr "PTXprint: Kamapim PicList"

#: temp.glade:2829
msgid "Append Pictures to PicList From These Books:"
msgstr "Putim Ol Pikja long PicList Long Ol Dispela Buk:"

