"use Title. NoteText makes this a kind of footnote, like \\x."
msgstr "[Mas gat] Dispela i tokim PTXprint olsem wanem long putim data long dispela marker. \n"
"Long tok bilong yu yet, ol nomol tok bilong bodi, usim VerseText. Sapos em i hap bilong\n"
"heding, usim Section. Sapos em i hap bilong taitel bilong wanpela buk, \n"
"usim Title. NoteText i mekim em i olsem futnot, wankain olsem \\x."

