msgstr "PTXprint i ken skelim ol USFM fail na stretim yet sampela asua i save kamap long sintaks. Em i ken tokim yu tu long ol asua i save mekim printim i pundaun, na givim yu helpim long wanem rot bilong stretim pastaim long yu traim printim gen."

