"\n"
"PTXprint inap tagim olgeta tok bilong\n"
"sos lanwis (Hibru na Grik) otomatik\n"
"wantaim stret markup, bai ol i soim\n"
"stret font na direksen bilong dispela skript."

#: temp.glade:35347
msgid "Lock XeTeX Layout Level"
msgstr "Lokim XeTeX Layout Level"

#: temp.glade:35352
msgid "This feature enables final typesetting to proceed \n"
"with minimal risk of change to the final layout by\n"
"locking the TeX macros to use the current layout\n"
"logic, which will prevent newer functionality\n"
"from taking effect in the future. This sets the\n"
"\"Maximum Layout Version\" value in the \n"
"TeXpert Hacks section."
msgstr "Dispela i larim las typesetting i go het\n"
"wantaim liklik hevi bilong senis long las layout.\n"
"I lokim ol TeX macro long yusim layout logic\n"
"bilong nau, na bai nupela fangksen i no inap\n"
"kam long bihain. Dispela i makim \"Maximum Layout Version\"\n"
"valu long TeXpert Hacks sekson."

#: temp.glade:35371 temp.glade:35372
msgid "Lock UI Layout Settings"
msgstr "Lokim UI Layout Seting"

#: temp.glade:35376
msgid "This feature enables final typesetting to proceed \n"
"with minimal risk of change to the final layout by\n"
"disabling various controls (on the layout, fonts and\n"
"styles tabs) so that settings can't be accidentally \n"
"changed while doing final page layout."
msgstr "Dispela i larim las typesetting i go het\n"
"wantaim liklik hevi bilong senis long las layout.\n"
"I pasim ol kontrol (long ol tab bilong layout, font na\n"
"style) olsem ol seting i no inap senis long asua\n"
"taim yu wokim las page layout."

