#: temp.glade:36109
msgid "Front Matter"
msgstr "Front Matter"

#: temp.glade:36134
msgid "To balance columns of text on a page it is possible\n"
"to specify paragraphs adjustments (shrink or expand):\n"
"\n"
"A Paragraph Adjust List needs to be in this format:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 2.7 by one line) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i.e. shrink the para at Mark 3:20 by one line)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (ignore this line - treat it as a comment)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i.e. expand the para at Mark 5.8 by two lines)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (expand the paragraph AFTER the paragraph \n"
"                              which contains MRK 6.23 e.g. a heading.)\n"
"\n"
"Diglot AdjList also need R or L to be specified after the book code\n"
"and it is important that L comes before R for the same verse.\n"
"MATL 3.4 +1\n"
"MATR 3.4 -1\n"
"MATR 3.11 +2\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-1 - makes the current line +1\n"
"  Ctrl-2 - makes the 2nd para of current line +1[2]\n"
"    ... etc ...\n"
"  Ctrl-9 - makes the 9th para of current line +1[9]\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-I - shrink current line -1\n"
"  Ctrl-Grave - ` same as above\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-0 - % Comment (or uncomment) the line [it toggles]\n"
"  Ctrl-Comma - same as above\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-D - Duplicate the current line\n"
"  Ctlr-L - deLete the current line\n"
"  Ctrl-Up - move the current line up one line\n"
"  Ctrl-Down - move the current line down one line\n"
"\n"
"Note that adjusting paragraphs needs to be done right at the\n"
"end when all other settings have been finalized. Otherwise you\n"
"are likely to have to re-do it all again."
msgstr "Long skelim ol kolum bilong tekst long wanpela pes,\n"
"yu ken makim ol senis bilong paragraf (liklikim o bikim):\n"
"\n"
"Paragraph Adjust List i mas i gat dispela fomat:\n"
"MRK 2.7 +1    (i min olsem, bikim paragraf long Mak 2.7 long wanpela lain) \n"
"MRK 3.20 -1   (i min olsem, liklikim paragraf long Mak 3:20 long wanpela lain)\n"
"%MARK 4.14 +1   (lusim dispela lain - em i komen tasol)   \n"
"MRK 5.8 +2    (i min olsem, bikim paragraf long Mak 5.8 long tupela lain)\n"
"MRK 6.23 +1[2]  (bikim paragraf BIHAIN long paragraf \n"
"                              i gat MRK 6.23 olsem hedin.)\n"
"\n"
"Diglot AdjList i nid long R o L bihain long kod bilong buk\n"
"na i bikpela samting olsem L i mas i stap pastaim long R bilong wankain ves.\n"
"MATL 3.4 +1\n"
"MATR 3.4 -1\n"
"MATR 3.11 +2\n"
"\n"
"Keyboard Shortcuts:\n"
"  Ctrl-1 - mekim lain i stap +1\n"
"  Ctrl-2 - mekim namba 2 paragraf bilong lain i stap +1[2]\n"
"    ... na olsem ...\n"
"  Ctrl-9 - mekim namba 9 paragraf bilong lain i stap +1[9]\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-I - liklikim lain i stap -1\n"
"  Ctrl-Grave - ` wankain olsem antap\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-0 - % Komen (o rausim komen) long lain [i senis i go i kam]\n"
"  Ctrl-Comma - wankain olsem antap\n"
"\n"
"  Ctrl-D - Kopiim lain i stap\n"
"  Ctlr-L - Rausim (deLete) lain i stap\n"
"  Ctrl-Up - muvim lain i stap i go antap long wanpela lain\n"
"  Ctrl-Down - muvim lain i stap i go daun long wanpela lain\n"
"\n"
"Lukim: sapos yu laik senisim ol paragraf, mekim long las tru\n"
"bihain long yu pinisim olgeta narapela seting. Sapos nogat,\n"
"bai yu mas mekim gen olgeta samting."

