"after any front matter material)."
msgstr "Olsem oltaim, bikpela hap bilong Skripsa i stat\n"
"long odd pes (right-hand-side). PTXprint bai\n"
"putim wanpela pagebreak yet sapos i gat nid long\n"
"mekim olsem. Sapos yu laik senisim dispela pasin,\n"
"makim dispela (bai i no putim blank pes\n"
"bihain long ol front matter)."

#: temp.glade:37089
msgid "Include Maps"
msgstr "Putim ol Map"

#: temp.glade:37206
msgid "Colophon Text:"
msgstr "Colophon Tekst:"

#: temp.glade:37236
msgid "Note: There are several shortcuts you can use:\n"
"   (c) --> ©  the copyright sign\n"
"   (r) --> ®  to denote registered trademarks\n"
"   (tm) --> ™  to denote trademarks in general\n"
"\n"
"Other special codes converted at print time:\n"
"use ~ for places where a non-breaking space is needed\n"
"use // where a line break needs to be forced\n"
"but :// used in URLs will still be preserved"
msgstr "Not: I gat sampela shortcut yu ken usim:\n"
"   (c) --> ©  mak bilong copyright\n"
"   (r) --> ®  long makim registered trademark\n"
"   (tm) --> ™  long makim trademark long olgeta\n"
"\n"
"Ol narapela spesel kod i senis long taim bilong print:\n"
"usim ~ long ples we i nid long non-breaking space\n"
"usim // long ples we i mas bruim lain\n"
"but :// long ol URL bai i stap yet"

#: temp.glade:37288
msgid "Force Page Break \n"
"Before Colophon"
msgstr "Mekim Page Break \n"
"Bipo long Colophon"

#: temp.glade:37295
msgid "Normally the colophon is inserted at the end\n"
"of the last page of the last book. If this option\n"
"is checked, then the colophon will appear at the \n"
"bottom of a new page at the end of the publication.\n"
"\n"
"In Diglot publications, the colophon always appears\n"
"on its own page - regardless of this setting. "
msgstr "Olsem oltaim colophon i go long pinis bilong\n"
"las pes bilong las buk. Sapos dispela i makim,\n"
"bai colophon i kamap long as bilong nupela pes\n"
"long pinis bilong publikesen.\n"
"\n"
"Long ol Diglot publikesen, colophon i save kamap\n"
"long wanpela pes bilong em yet - maski dispela seting i olsem wanem. "

#: temp.glade:37316
msgid "Colophon at End of Publication"
msgstr "Colophon long Pinis bilong Publikesen"

#: temp.glade:37360
msgid "Back Matter PDF(s)"
msgstr "Back Matter PDF"

#: temp.glade:37366
msgid "One or more previously created PDF file(s) can be included\n"
"AFTER the scripture material being typeset. If more than one\n"
"file is selected, then these will appear in alphabetical order."
msgstr "Wanpela o moa PDF fail ol i bin mekim bipo inap i go\n"
"BIHAIN long Skripsa tekst ol i printim. Sapos yu makim\n"
"moa long wanpela fail, ol bai i kamap long alfabet orda."

#: temp.glade:37441
msgid "Clicking this button will rescan the\n"
"Front Matter for any \\zvar|variables\\*\n"
"and add any that are missing to this\n"
"table of variable names and values."
msgstr "Klikim dispela boton long skanim gen\n"
"Front Matter long painim ol \\zvar|variables\\*\n"
"na putim ol i no stap yet long dispela\n"
"tebol bilong nem na velyu bilong variable."

#: temp.glade:37499
msgid "Pub"
msgstr "Pub"

#: temp.glade:37570
msgid "This table lists the standard set of \\zvar|variables\\* which\n"
"can be used as part of front matter and/or colophon. \n"
"As these \\zvar|variables\\* are customizable, you can\n"
"add your own as needed. For example, you may\n"
"need the \\zvar|maintitle\\* in more than one language\n"
"so you can add 'fr' or 'es' to create a new one:\n"
"  \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"or you might want to add a custom variable such as:\n"
"   \\zvar|printedby\\*\n"
"\n"
"The values of these variables are saved with the config \n"
"as they might vary from one publication to another."
msgstr "Dispela tebol i soim ol standet \\zvar|variables\\* we\n"
"yu ken usim long front matter na/o colophon.\n"
"Ol dispela \\zvar|variables\\* i ken senis, olsem na yu ken\n"
"putim bilong yu yet. Olsem, yu ken nidim\n"
"\\zvar|maintitle\\* long moa long wanpela tokples,\n"
"olsem na yu ken putim 'fr' o 'es' long mekim nupela:\n"
"  \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"o yu ken putim wanpela variable bilong yu olsem:\n"
"   \\zvar|printedby\\*\n"
"\n"
"Ol velyu bilong ol dispela variable i stap long config\n"
"bilong em, long wanem, i ken senis long wanpela\n"
"publikesen na narapela."

#: temp.glade:37584
msgid "Variables and Values:"
msgstr "Ol Variable na Velyu:"

#: temp.glade:37615
msgid "Delete the currently\n"
"selected variable(s)."
msgstr "Rausim ol variable\n"
"yu makim pinis."

#: temp.glade:37635
msgid "Add a new variable."
msgstr "Putim wanpela nupela variable."

#: temp.glade:37668
msgid "Define what material should be\n"
"placed before and/or after the\n"
"main scripture pages."
msgstr "Makim wanem samting i go\n"
"bilong stap paslain na/o biihain\n"
"long ol main peis bilong Skripsa."

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3004 temp.glade:37672
msgid "Peripherals"
msgstr "Peripherals"

#: temp.glade:37694
msgid "<span size=\"large\"><b>Publications</b></span>"
msgstr "<span size=\"large\"><b>Ol Publikesen</b></span>"

#: temp.glade:37734
msgid "Add a new publication, filled in from\n"
"the current configuration: the books\n"
"chosen on the Basic tab, and the title,\n"
"subtitle and other publishable \\zvars\n"
"from the Peripherals tab."
