msgstr "Soim ol detel bilong olgeta publikesen."

#: temp.glade:37813
msgid "Collapse All"
msgstr "Pasim Olgeta"

#: temp.glade:37817
msgid "Hide the details of every publication."
msgstr "Haidim ol detel bilong olgeta publikesen."

#: temp.glade:37873
msgid "Publication ID / Field"
msgstr "ID bilong Publikesen / Fil"

#: temp.glade:37889
msgid "Books / Value"
msgstr "Ol Buk / Veliu"

#: temp.glade:37934
msgid "Print Selected"
msgstr "Printim Ol Yu Makim"

#: temp.glade:37969
msgid "Publications"
msgstr "Ol Publikesen"

#: temp.glade:38014
msgid "Set parameters for the cover\n"
"of the publication."
msgstr "Putim ol seting bilong\n"
"kava bilong publikesen."

#: temp.glade:38062 temp.glade:38162
msgid "How many pages will be printed on\n"
"one side of the physical paper?\n"
"\n"
"For example, for an A5-sized booklet,\n"
"2 pages will fit on each side, making a\n"
"total of 4 pages on a single sheet."
msgstr "Hamas peis bai i kamap long\n"
"wanpela sait bilong pepa?\n"
"\n"
"Pela eksampel, long wanpela buklet\n"
"bilong A5, 2 peis i ken pas long\n"
"kain sait, olsem na 4 peis i stap\n"
"long wanpela sit."

#: temp.glade:38069
msgid "Pages Per Spread:"
msgstr "Peis long Wanpela Spred:"

#: temp.glade:38080
msgid "This is the actual size of the sheet of\n"
"paper on which multiple pages will\n"
"be printed. For example, if printing\n"
"an A5-sized booklet, the actual sheet\n"
"of paper that you print on will be\n"
"2x the A5-sized page, which is an\n"
"A4-sized sheet of paper."
msgstr "Dispela em i bikpela bilong sit bilong\n"
"pepa we planti peis bai i kamap long en.\n"
"Pela eksampel, sapos yu printim wanpela\n"
"buklet bilong A5, sit pepa yu printim long\n"
"en bai i 2 taim bikpela bilong A5 peis,\n"
"em i A4 sit pepa."

#: temp.glade:38089
msgid "Physical\n"
"Paper Size:"
msgstr "Bikpela bilong\n"
"Sit Pepa:"

#: temp.glade:38102 temp.glade:38235
msgid "A signature is a collection of pages folded\n"
"and bound together as a unit. A signature\n"
"may be made up of multiple sheets.\n"
"\n"
"If unsure, leave this setting at 0 to indicate\n"
"that the publication will not be bound \n"
"using separate signatures."
msgstr "Wanpela signecha em i ol peis ol i foldim\n"
"na bindim wantaim olsem wanpela. Wanpela\n"
"signecha i ken gat planti sit.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu no save, larim dispela seting i stap\n"
"long 0 bilong soim olsem ol i no inap bindim\n"
"buk long ol narapela narapela signecha."

#: temp.glade:38110
msgid "Sheets Per Signature:"
msgstr "Ol Sit long Wanpela Signecha:"

#: temp.glade:38122
msgid "If the required size is not displayed, then \n"
"just type the required page width and \n"
"height separated by a comma. \n"
"\n"
"For example: 203mm, 330mm (Foolscap)"
msgstr "Sapos bikpela yu laikim i no stap,\n"
"yu ken taipim wit na hait bilong peis\n"
"na putim komap namel long tupela.\n"
"\n"
"Pela eksampel: 203mm, 330mm (Foolscap)"

#: temp.glade:38193
msgid "Scale to fit"
msgstr "Skelim long fit"

#: temp.glade:38216
msgid "The minimum width of the area to\n"
"be cut after folding of the signature.\n"
"Measured in millimeters (mm)."
msgstr "Liklik wit bilong hap ol i mas katim\n"
"bihain long foldim bilong signecha.\n"
"Ol i skelim long milimita (mm)."

#: temp.glade:38222
msgid "Fold Cut \n"
"Margin (mm):"
msgstr "Margin bilong\n"
"Kat long Fold (mm):"

#: temp.glade:38277
msgid "Fold First"
msgstr "Fold Pastaim"

#: temp.glade:38282
msgid "If you are imposing for a printer with a folding machine, \n"
"then you want to fold first and then cut. This, for example\n"
"makes a folded sheet that is part of a signature consist of\n"
"two sets of sequential pages."
msgstr "Sapos yu makim ol pes bilong printa i gat masin bilong fold, orait yu laik fold pastaim na bihain katim. Olsem, wanpela sit i fold i stap insait long wanpela signature, em i kamap tupela hap pes i kisim namba i stret."

#: temp.glade:38296
msgid "Create Cover as \n"
"a Separate PDF"
msgstr "Kamapim Kava olsem\n"
"Wanpela Narapela PDF"

#: temp.glade:38303
msgid "This option is only available if Create Cover is\n"
"enabled on the Cover tab. Enable this option if\n"
"you plan to print the outer (wrapper) cover\n"
"separately from the book's content. This is often\n"
"the case if cardstock, or a colour cover is used."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i save wok sapos Kamapim Kava i op long tab Kava. Yusim dispela opsen sapos yu laik printim kava bilong ausait (wrapper) i narapela long ol pes insait bilong buk. Ol i save mekim olsem sapos ol i yusim kardstok, o kava i gat kala."

#: temp.glade:38327
msgid "Whether you need a simple booklet\n"
"or a more complex signature, these\n"
"options allow plenty of scope."
msgstr "Sapos yu laik wanpela liklik buk o wanpela signature i hatwok moa, ol dispela opsen i ken helpim yu long olgeta samting."

#: temp.glade:38330
msgid "Booklet Pagination"
msgstr "Pagination bilong Liklik Buk"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:2988 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:5387 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:5403 lib/ptxprint/runjob.py:859 temp.glade:38391
msgid "Previous PDF (_1)"
msgstr "Pastaim PDF (_1)"

#: temp.glade:38403
msgid "Only Show Pages\n"
"With Differences"
msgstr "Soim Ol Pes Tasol\n"
"I Gat Senis"

#: temp.glade:38409
msgid "When comparing two PDF files the\n"
"resulting \"Diff\" PDF can get rather\n"
"large. This option reduces the size\n"
"of the PDF by not including any\n"
"identical pages. This also saves\n"
"time as you don't need to search\n"
"through a lengthy PDF to find\n"
"out what might have changed."
msgstr "Taim yu kompia tupela PDF fail, PDF \"Diff\" i kamap i ken bikpela tumas. Dispela opsen i mekim PDF i liklik moa, long wanem em i no putim ol pes i wankain. Em i save sevim taim tu, long wanem yu no needim painim long wanpela longpela PDF long save wanem samting i senis."

#: temp.glade:38435
msgid "Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been added (or moved to\n"
"the current location) in the new PDF."
msgstr "Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i putim (o ol i muvim i kam long ples nau) long nupela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38440
msgid "Color to Highlight Differences"
msgstr "Kala long Soim Ol Senis"

#: temp.glade:38453
msgid "Set the color to use when\n"
"differences are found between\n"
"the old and the new PDFs.\n"
"\n"
"Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been added (or moved to\n"
"the current location) in the new PDF."
msgstr "Makim kala bilong yusim taim ol i painim ol senis namel long olpela PDF na nupela PDF.\n"
"\n"
"Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i putim (o ol i muvim i kam long ples nau) long nupela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38463
msgid "Show New Text\n"
"or Position in:"
msgstr "Soim Nupela Tok\n"
"o Ples long:"

#: temp.glade:38476 temp.glade:38580
msgid "Set the color to use when\n"
"differences are found between\n"
"the old and the new PDFs.\n"
"\n"
"Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been deleted (or moved from\n"
"the previous location) in the old PDF."
msgstr "Makim kala bilong yusim taim ol i painim ol senis namel long olpela PDF na nupela PDF.\n"
"\n"
"Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i rausim (o ol i muvim i go long ples bipo) long olpela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38486
msgid "Show Old Text\n"
"or Position in:"
msgstr "Soim Olpela Tok\n"
"o Ples long:"

#: temp.glade:38499
msgid "Use this color to show anything\n"
"that has been deleted (or moved from\n"
"the previous location) in the old PDF."
msgstr "Yusim dispela kala long soim olgeta samting ol i rausim (o ol i muvim i go long ples bipo) long olpela PDF."

#: temp.glade:38520
msgid "Select a particular PDF file to be compared \n"
"against the current output PDF. If you just \n"
"want to compare output to the previous run,\n"
"then click Cancel in the File Open dialog\n"
"to reset the filename (which will then\n"
"default to _1)."
msgstr "Makim wanpela PDF fail bilong kompia wantaim PDF bilong nau. Sapos yu laik kompia tasol wantaim PDF bilong las taim, klikim Cancel long File Open dialog long senisim nem bilong fail (em bai i go bek long _1)."

#: temp.glade:38528
msgid "Compare With \n"
"a Previous PDF:"
msgstr "Kompia Wantaim\n"
"Olpela PDF:"

#: temp.glade:38545
msgid "The PDF showing differences between the old\n"
"and the new contains images that make the\n"
"resulting file rather large. Use this option to\n"
"limit the number of \"Diff\" pages created.\n"
"This will also potentially speed up the process."
msgstr "PDF i soim ol senis namel long olpela na nupela i gat ol piksa, na dispela i mekim fail i kamap bikpela tumas. Yusim dispela opsen long limitim namba bilong ol pes \"Diff\" ol i kamapim. Em i ken mekim wok i go kwik moa tu."

#: temp.glade:38589
msgid "Show Max\n"
"Diff Pages:"
msgstr "Maksimum Namba\n"
"bilong Pes Diff:"

#: temp.glade:38608
msgid "Compare PDFs"
msgstr "Kompia ol PDF"

#: temp.glade:38715
msgid "PDF Output Format:"
msgstr "PDF Output Format:"

#: temp.glade:38725
msgid "Crop Marks"
msgstr "Crop Marks"

#: temp.glade:38730
msgid "Some printers require crop marks\n"
"on the PDF to show where the page\n"
"should be trimmed after binding."
msgstr "Sampela printa i laik gat crop marks long PDF long soim we ol i mas katim pes bihain long ol i bainim buk."

#: temp.glade:38769
msgid "By keeping previous versions of the\n"
"PDF, it is possible to compare the\n"
"final output of the PDFs. Up to 20 \n"
"previous versions can be kept.\n"
"\n"
"If you need to keep a PDF around\n"
"longer, then manually rename it\n"
"so that it can be compared to at a\n"
"later date."
msgstr "Taim yu holim ol olpela PDF, yu ken kompia ol las PDF. Inap 20 olpela PDF i ken stap.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik holim wanpela PDF longpela taim moa, senisim nem bilong en wantaim han, na bihain yu ken kompia long en."

#: temp.glade:38781
msgid "Number of Previous\n"
"PDFs to be Kept:"
msgstr "Hamas PDF Bilong Bipo\n"
"I Mas Stap:"

#: temp.glade:38792
msgid "Include Config Settings Within PDF"
msgstr "Putim Ol Config Seting Insait long PDF"

#: temp.glade:38797
msgid "All the configuration settings (including\n"
"the PTXprint styles, AdjLists, changes.txt,\n"
"and related .tex files) can be included\n"
"within the PDF in order to maintain a\n"
"record of what settings were used to\n"
"create that PDF.\n"
"Later, these settings can be retrieved\n"
"from the PDF to set up an identical\n"
"configuration. This is also a way to\n"
"share config settings with other users."
msgstr "Ol configuration seting olgeta (wantaim\n"
"ol PTXprint style, AdjLists, changes.txt,\n"
"na ol .tex file i go wantaim) i ken stap\n"
"insait long PDF bilong holim rekod bilong\n"
"ol seting ol i yusim long mekim dispela PDF.\n"
"Bihain, yu ken kisim ol dispela seting\n"
"long PDF bilong setapim wanpela configuration\n"
"i stret wankain. Dispela em i wanpela rot\n"
"tu bilong serim ol config seting wantaim\n"
"ol arapela yusa."

#: temp.glade:38821
msgid "Archive (PDF/A-4)"
msgstr "Archive (PDF/A-4)"

#: temp.glade:38826
msgid "Check this option to include the Unicode\n"
"text in the PDF which is a good practice\n"
"for final print and long-term archiving.\n"
"PDF/A-4 is the currently preferred\n"
"archival format."
msgstr "Makim dispela option bilong putim Unicode\n"
"text insait long PDF. Dispela i gutpela pasin\n"
"bilong las print na bilong holim long longpela\n"
"taim. PDF/A-4 em i archive format ol i laikim\n"
"nau."

#: temp.glade:38855
msgid "Spot Color Hue"
msgstr "Spot Color Hue"

#: temp.glade:38875
msgid "Color Hue:"
msgstr "Color Hue:"

#: temp.glade:38887 temp.glade:38922
msgid "To match the Spot Color Hue exactly, set this\n"
"to 0%. If text in similar colors are also to be\n"
"set to this Spot Color, then select an acceptable\n"
"tolerance range (suggested default is 15%).\n"
"\n"
"Note that this will include similar colors either \n"
"side (e.g. -15% to +15%) of the selected hue."
msgstr "Bilong stretim stret long Spot Color Hue, putim\n"
"i go long 0%. Sapos ol text i gat ol kala i klostu\n"
"wankain tu i mas kamap long dispela Spot Color,\n"
"makim wanpela tolerance i orait (em i stat long 15%).\n"
"\n"
"Olsem na dispela bai putim ol kala i klostu long\n"
"tupela sait (olsem -15% i go long +15%) bilong\n"
"hue ol i makim."

#: temp.glade:38932
msgid "Tolerance (%):"
msgstr "Tolerance (%):"

#: temp.glade:38943
msgid "Extract Color Inserts"
msgstr "Rausim Ol Color Insert"

#: temp.glade:38948
msgid "Extract the special peripheral materials\n"
"named 'maps' or 'insert_*' as separate \n"
"PDFs to be printed in color and inserted\n"
"manually during the binding process.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the cover is always extracted."
msgstr "Rausim ol spesel peripheral material ol i kolim\n"
"'maps' o 'insert_*' olsem ol arapela PDF bilong\n"
"ol i printim long kala na putim long han long taim\n"
"bilong bainim buk.\n"
"\n"
"Notim olsem cover i save kamap arasait oltaim."

#: temp.glade:38967
msgid "Extra XDV Processing"
msgstr "Extra XDV Processing"

#: temp.glade:38972
msgid "Enable processing of the intermediate xdv\n"
"file for such things as coloured diacritics."
msgstr "Larim processing bilong xdv file i stap namel\n"
"long ol samting olsem ol diacritic i gat kala."

#: temp.glade:38996
msgid "Apply Watermark PDF"
msgstr "Putim Watermark PDF"

#: temp.glade:39001
msgid "A watermark can be applied to all pages of \n"
"the publication. The file must be a PDF and\n"
"should ideally have the same dimensions as \n"
"the publication being printed."
msgstr "Yu ken putim wanpela watermark long olgeta pes\n"
"bilong buk. Dispela file i mas PDF na i gutpela\n"
"sapos sais bilong en i wankain long buk ol\n"
"i printim."

#: temp.glade:39064
msgid "PDF Details"
msgstr "PDF Details"

#: temp.glade:39083
msgid "Options to control pagination,\n"
"PDF output format and compare\n"
"output with a previous PDF."
msgstr "Ol option bilong bosim pagination,\n"
"PDF output format na bilong skelim\n"
"output wantaim wanpela PDF bipo."

