#: temp.glade:39152
msgid "Spine/book thickness for the currently selected printer, based on its paper stock and binding."
msgstr "Spine/tikpela bilong buk bilong printa ol i makim nau, i kam long paper na binding bilong en."

#: temp.glade:39154
