"Try using the 'Tidy Up' button on the Help tab and then try again.\n"
"If you are still unable to proceed, use the 'Create Archive...' button\n"
"on the Help tab to create a .zip file. Send it to your PTXprint support person\n"
"for further assistance. Please include a description of the problem, and if\n"
"known, state which setting was changed since it last worked."
msgstr "Oops! Wanpela samting i no stret i kamap na kamapim dispela hevi mipela i no save long en.\n"
"Traim long yusim boton 'Tidy Up' long Help tab na traim gen.\n"
"Sapos yu no inap go het yet, yusim boton 'Create Archive...'\n"
"long Help tab bilong wokim wanpela .zip file. Salim i go long man bilong helpim PTXprint\n"
"bilong kisim moa halivim. Plis raitim stori bilong hevi, na sapos yu save,\n"
"raitim wanem seting yu senisim bihain long taim em i wok gut."

#: lib/ptxprint/runjob.py:872
msgid "No differences found"
msgstr "I no gat ol difrens"

