"Page (in Margins) em bilong ol sidebar i karamapim olgeta pes (i min, i no gat Skripsa tekst long dispela pes), tasol header i stap yet.\n"
"\n"
"Page (to Edge) em bilong ol sidebar i pulim olgeta pes, na i no gat margin at all."

