#: temp.glade:17424 temp.glade:17456
msgid "Use 3-letter USFM book codes (e.g. JHN, not John; MRK, not Mark).\n"
"\n"
"A list of references can be entered if printing less\n"
"than an entire book or chapter, or if you need to\n"
"include portions from several books. For example:\n"
"  JHN 2:1-12\n"
"  MRK 1-5\n"
"  PSA 23; 100; 117\n"
"  EXO 20:12-17 MAT 5:3-11\n"
"  GEN 1:1-2:3 PSA 23:1-end LUK 15:11-32 GLO\n"
"  GEN 24:1-17; 24:22-30\n"
"  MAT-REV\n"
"\n"
"If working on several books, use the Choose...\n"
"button to select multiple books. For example:\n"
"  LUK ACT GLO NDX\n"
"prints Luke, Acts, Glossary and Names Index.\n"
"The list is editable, so books can be re-ordered\n"
"if need be (for example, for the Hebrew canon).\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-B"
msgstr "Usim ol USFM kod bilong buk i gat 3-pela leta (olsem JHN, i no John; MRK, i no Mark).\n"
"\n"
"Yu ken putim wanpela lista bilong ol ples bilong Baibel sapos yu laik printim liklik hap tasol bilong buk o kapitel, o sapos yu laik putim ol hap bilong planti buk. Olsem:\n"
"  JHN 2:1-12\n"
"  MRK 1-5\n"
"  PSA 23; 100; 117\n"
"  EXO 20:12-17 MAT 5:3-11\n"
"  GEN 1:1-2:3 PSA 23:1-end LUK 15:11-32 GLO\n"
"  GEN 24:1-17; 24:22-30\n"
"  MAT-REV\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu wokim planti buk, usim boton Makim... long makim planti buk. Olsem:\n"
"  LUK ACT GLO NDX\n"
"bai i printim Luk, Aktis, Glossary na Names Index.\n"
"Yu ken senisim lista, olsem na yu ken senisim ol buk i go namba narapela\n"
"sapos i gat nid (olsem, long Hebrew canon).\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut: Ctrl-B"

