#: temp.glade:18302
msgid "Include ruled margins to provide space\n"
"for personal notes, reflections, and artwork.\n"
"Typically called 'Journaling Bibles' or 'Wide-\n"
"Margin Bibles'.\n"
"\n"
"Hint: Set the Binding Gutter to a larger value\n"
"(>40mm) and enable Outer Gutter. Other\n"
"settings to control the appearance and spacing\n"
"of the Notelines are in the 'Page Layout and\n"
"Spacing' section of the Advanced > Other tab."
msgstr "Putim ol margin igat ol line bilong givim ples\n"
"long ol not bilong yu yet, ol tingting, na ol piksa.\n"
"Ol i save kolim 'Journaling Bibles' o 'Wide-\n"
"Margin Bibles'.\n"
"\n"
"Sampela tok: Makim Binding Gutter long wanpela\n"
"bikpela namba (>40mm) na onim Outer Gutter. Ol narapela\n"
"seting bilong kontrolim ol Notelines i stap long\n"
"'Page Layout and Spacing' long Advanced > Other tab."

#: temp.glade:18343
