"o liklik moa long nem bilong nupela projek. Noken yusim\n"
"nem bilong wanpela projek i stap pinis."

#: temp.glade:18657
msgid "Check this option to allow a different\n"
"number of lines in each column. This\n"
"is especially important when using\n"
"Variable Line Spacing mode and\n"
"you are trying to Fill Columns.\n"
"\n"
"To alter the maximum number of\n"
"Unbalanced Lines at the end of a\n"
"page, visit the Advanced page,\n"
"select the Other tab, and expand\n"
"the Page Layout and Spacing section.\n"
"\n"
"If this setting is highlighted in orange\n"
"it means that the abovementioned\n"
"setting was set to 0 (rendering this\n"
"setting inactive), and has now been\n"
"increased to the default value of 3."
msgstr "Makim dispela opsen bilong larim narapela\n"
"namba bilong ol line long olgeta kolum. Dispela\n"
"i bikpela samting taim yu yusim\n"
"Variable Line Spacing mode na\n"
"yu laik Fill Columns.\n"
"\n"
"Bilong senisim biggest namba bilong\n"
"Unbalanced Lines long las bilong wanpela\n"
"pes, go long Advanced pes,\n"
"makim Other tab, na opim\n"
"Page Layout and Spacing section.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos dispela seting i orens\n"
"i min olsem seting antap i stap long 0 (na dispela\n"
"seting i no wok), na nau i go antap\n"
"long namba bilong i stap pinis, em 3."

#: temp.glade:18745
msgid "One or two column layout"
msgstr "Wanpela o tupela kolum layout"

#: temp.glade:18749
msgid "If this setting is checked on, but\n"
"inactive, it is due to Diglot being\n"
"active (which obviously must use \n"
"the Two Column layout).\n"
"\n"
"If you get an unexpected result, check\n"
"the \"Use One/Two Column Layout ...\"\n"
"setting near the end of the Body tab\n"
"which is only accessible when using\n"
"the Full View mode."
msgstr "Sapos dispela seting i makim pinis, tasol\n"
"i no wok, em bikos Diglot i wok\n"
"(na Diglot i mas yusim\n"
"Two Column layout).\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu kisim wanpela samting yu no bin\n"
"bilip long en, lukim seting \"Use One/Two Column Layout ...\"\n"
"i stap klostu long las bilong Body tab\n"
"na yu inap lukim tasol taim yu yusim\n"
"Full View mode."

#: temp.glade:1881
msgid "Assign a name to a DBL bundle"
msgstr "Givim nem long wanpela DBL bundle"

#: temp.glade:18815
msgid "Header spacing"
msgstr "Spes bilong header"

#: temp.glade:18851
msgid "Footer position"
msgstr "Ples bilong footer"

#: temp.glade:18883
msgid "Bottom margin"
msgstr "Margin long graun"

#: temp.glade:18920
msgid "Side margin width"
msgstr "Weit bilong sait margin"

#: temp.glade:18958
msgid "Space between horizontal rule and main text area"
msgstr "Spes namel long horizontal rule na main tekst eria"

#: temp.glade:18961 temp.glade:19648
msgid "The space (pt) between the horizontal rule\n"
"and the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Spes (pt) namel long horizontal rule\n"
"na antap bilong main tekst eria. Tingim olsem\n"
"first line i save stat liklik daun long ples\n"
"main tekst eria i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong main tekst eria em 1 base line spacing\n"
"antap long base line bilong first line bilong body tekst."

#: temp.glade:18995
msgid "Top margin"
msgstr "Margin long antap"

#: temp.glade:18998 temp.glade:19580
msgid "The distance (mm) from the top of the page\n"
"to the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Longpela (mm) long antap bilong pes i go daun long antap bilong ples bilong main text.\n"
"Tingim olsem namba wan lain i stat liklik daun long ples we main text i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong ples bilong main text i stap 1 base line spacing\n"
"antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong body text."

#: temp.glade:19033
msgid "Tweak top margin (auto adjust)"
msgstr "Senisim liklik top margin (auto adjust)"

#: temp.glade:19068
msgid "Tweak bottom margin (auto adjust)"
msgstr "Senisim liklik bottom margin (auto adjust)"

#: temp.glade:19416
msgid "Don't place footer in the margin area"
msgstr "Noken putim footer long ples bilong margin"

#: temp.glade:19420
msgid "Normally the footer page number sits\n"
"in the bottom margin. \n"
"\n"
"However if you need  the page number to\n"
"be placed above the bottom margin (where\n"
"the text would normally flow until) then \n"
"enable this option."
msgstr "Olgeta taim namba bilong pes long footer i stap long bottom margin.\n"
"\n"
"Tasol sapos yu laik putim namba bilong pes antap long bottom margin (ples we text i save ran i go inap long en), orait opim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:1950
msgid "Visit the Digital Bible Library to download a DBL Scripture bundle"
msgstr "Go long Digital Bible Library bilong daunim wanpela DBL Scripture bundle"

#: temp.glade:19614
msgid "The space (pt) between the bottom of the header\n"
"and the top of the main text area. Note that\n"
"the first line actually starts a little bit below\n"
"where the the main text area starts.\n"
"\n"
"The top of the main text area is 1 base line spacing \n"
"above the base line of the first line of the body text."
msgstr "Spes (pt) namba bilong daun bilong header na antap bilong ples bilong main text.\n"
"Tingim olsem namba wan lain i stat liklik daun long ples we main text i stat.\n"
"\n"
"Antap bilong ples bilong main text i stap 1 base line spacing\n"
"antap long base line bilong namba wan lain bilong body text."

#: temp.glade:19679
msgid "Footer position - space between text and footer"
msgstr "Ples bilong footer - spes namba bilong text na footer"

#: temp.glade:19871
msgid "Select Regular font"
msgstr "Makim Regular font"

#: temp.glade:19894
msgid "Select Bold font"
msgstr "Makim Bold font"

#: temp.glade:19914
msgid "Select Italic font"
msgstr "Makim Italic font"

#: temp.glade:19934
msgid "Select Bold Italic font"
msgstr "Makim Bold Italic font"

#: temp.glade:19953
msgid "Refresh Font List button"
msgstr "Boton bilong Refresh Font List"

#: temp.glade:20085
msgid "Find Missing Characters button"
msgstr "Boton bilong Painim Ol Missing Character"

#: temp.glade:20133
msgid "Select font to display missing characters"
msgstr "Makim font bilong soim ol missing character"

#: temp.glade:20149
msgid "Missing Characters"
msgstr "Ol Missing Character"

#: temp.glade:2019
msgid "Visit the Open.Bible site to download a Scripture bundle"
msgstr "Go long sait bilong Open.Bible bilong daunim wanpela Scripture bundle"

#: temp.glade:20234
msgid "To hyphenate properly you need to first create a \n"
"Hyphenation List using the button on the left.\n"
"This will create a XeTeX hyphenation list from the\n"
"hyphenation list in Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Note that for Hyphenation to work properly, the\n"
"Spacing Adjustments 'Between Letters' option needs \n"
"to be disabled."
msgstr "Bilong hyphenate stret, yu mas kamapim wanpela Hyphenation List pastaim long boton i stap long ruasait.\n"
"Dispela bai kamapim wanpela XeTeX hyphenation list long hyphenation list bilong Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem bilong Hyphenation i wok stret, opsen 'Between Letters' bilong Spacing Adjustments i mas i no gat mak."

#: temp.glade:20254
msgid "Import List..."
msgstr "Import List..."

#: temp.glade:20255
msgid "Create Hyphenation List"
msgstr "Kamapim Hyphenation List"

#: temp.glade:20278
msgid "Omit hyphen from hyphenated words"
msgstr "Rausim hyphen long ol hyphenated word"

#: temp.glade:20302
msgid "Enable this option to ensure that word-medial hyphens\n"
"within the text never break across two lines.\n"
"\n"
"By default, word-\n"
"medial may break\n"
"across two lines.\n"
"\n"
"If enabled, word-medial will\n"
"always stay on the same line."
msgstr "Opim dispela opsen bilong mekim ol word-medial hyphen insait long text i no ken brukim tupela lain.\n"
"\n"
"Olgeta taim, word-\n"
"medial inap brukim tupela lain.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos opsen i op, word-medial bai i stap oltaim long wanpela lain."

#: temp.glade:20376
msgid "Spacing Between Words"
msgstr "Spes Namba bilong Ol Word"

#: temp.glade:20400
msgid "Spacing Between Letters"
msgstr "Spes Namba bilong Ol Letter"

#: temp.glade:20404
msgid "Enabling letter spacing allows the spaces between\n"
"characters to be adjusted (usually by a very small\n"
"percentage). This might help alleviate space problems.\n"
"Values are in percentage of the text point size and \n"
"get used everywhere. \n"
"\n"
"Warning: Only use this if really needed!\n"
"In some cases, enabling this setting will prevent\n"
"hyphenation from working at all. In other cases it \n"
"can make the text look very ugly.\n"
"\n"
"Note that if this option is disabled, then it is due to\n"
"the Interlinear option being set on the Advanced page.\n"
"These two settings are mutually exclusive."
msgstr "Sapos yu opim letter spacing, ol spes namba bilong ol character inap senis (long liklik pesentis tasol). Dispela inap helpim sapos i gat hevi long spes.\n"
"Ol value i long pesentis bilong point size bilong text na i wok long olgeta hap.\n"
"\n"
"Woning: Yusim dispela sapos yu nidim tru tasol!\n"
"Long sampela taim, dispela seting i pasim hyphenation i no inap wok olgeta. Long sampela narapela taim, text inap luk nogut tumas.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem sapos dispela opsen i no inap wok, em bilong wanem opsen Interlinear i stap long Advanced page. Dispela tupela seting i no inap wok wantaim."

#: temp.glade:20431
msgid "Spacing Between Words (Min/Shrink)"
msgstr "Spes namel long ol wed (Min/Shrink)"

#: temp.glade:20464
msgid "Spacing Between Words (Max/Stretch)"
msgstr "Spes namel long ol wed (Max/Stretch)"

#: temp.glade:20497
msgid "Spacing Between Letters (Min/Shrink)"
msgstr "Spes namel long ol leta (Min/Shrink)"

#: temp.glade:20516
msgid "Spacing Between Letters (Max/Stretch)"
msgstr "Spes namel long ol leta (Max/Stretch)"

#: temp.glade:20636
msgid "Text direction (Right-to-left RTL etc)"
msgstr "Direksen bilong tekst (Right-to-left RTL na ol narapela)"

#: temp.glade:20672
msgid "Text script"
msgstr "Skript bilong tekst"

#: temp.glade:20676
msgid "PTXprint provides additional typesetting \n"
"functionality for some complex scripts: \n"
"arab, mymr, thai, knda, orya, mlym, taml, telu\n"
"\n"
"In most cases leave this setting as \"Default\"."
msgstr "PTXprint i givim moa typesetting \n"
"fankson long sampela hat skript: \n"
"arab, mymr, thai, knda, orya, mlym, taml, telu\n"
"\n"
"Long planti taim, larim dispela seting i stap \"Default\"."

#: temp.glade:20705
msgid "A small number of complex scripts (such as\n"
"Burmese & Indic) have additional options\n"
"which can be set individually."
msgstr "Sampela liklik hat skript (olsem\n"
"Burmese na Indic) i gat moa opsen\n"
"ol i ken seting long wanwan."

#: temp.glade:20734
msgid "Enable Line Break Locale"
msgstr "Opim Line Break Locale"

#: temp.glade:20757
msgid "Set Line Break Locale"
msgstr "Makim Line Break Locale"

#: temp.glade:20761
msgid "ja = Japanese\n"
"km = Khmer\n"
"ko = Korean\n"
"my = Myanmar\n"
"th = Thai\n"
"zh = Chinese\n"
"   OR\n"
"gr = Graphite"
msgstr "ja = Japanese\n"
"km = Khmer\n"
"ko = Korean\n"
"my = Myanmar\n"
"th = Thai\n"
"zh = Chinese\n"
"   O\n"
"gr = Graphite"

#: temp.glade:20792
msgid "Set the binding to Right (for RTL publications)"
msgstr "Makim binding i go long Right (long ol buk RTL)"

#: temp.glade:20902
msgid "Enable book introductions (\\i..)"
msgstr "Opim introduksen bilong buk (\\i..)"

#: temp.glade:20923
msgid "Enable introductory outlines"
msgstr "Opim ol introduksen outline"

#: temp.glade:20944
msgid "Enable Right-aligned outlines with leaders"
msgstr "Opim ol outline i stap long sait bilong rait wantaim ol leader"

#: temp.glade:20961
msgid "Filter glossary"
msgstr "Filta glosari"

#: temp.glade:20965
msgid "This option is only available if the GLO book\n"
"is also selected.\n"
"If you have large glossary with many entries \n"
"but are only printing a small selection of books, \n"
"you may benefit from this option which will \n"
"strip out any entries from the Glossary which\n"
"are not marked-up in the text of the selected \n"
"book(s) or chapter(s).\n"
"i.e. only the \\w marked-up\\w* entries in the \n"
"selected books/chapters will show in the glossary."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i stap tasol sapos buk GLO\n"
"i makim tu.\n"
"Sapos yu gat bikpela glosari i gat planti entri\n"
"makim, tasol yu printim sampela liklik buk tasol,\n"
"yu ken yusim dispela opsen. Em bai rausim olgeta entri\n"
"bilong Glosari i no gat mak long tekst bilong\n"
"buk o kapitel yu makim.\n"
"Inap long tok, ol entri \\w i gat mak\\w* tasol long\n"
"ol buk/kapitel yu makim bai soim long glosari."

#: temp.glade:20987
msgid "Start every chapter on a new page"
msgstr "Statim olgeta kapitel long nupela pes"

#: temp.glade:21007
msgid "Start new page after introduction"
msgstr "Statim nupela pes bihain long introduksen"

#: temp.glade:21071
msgid "Hide first verse number"
msgstr "Hait namba bilong namba wan ves"

#: temp.glade:21075
msgid "It is quite common to hide the first verse\n"
"number - especially when following a\n"
"drop-cap chapter number. By default this\n"
"option is on. If you prefer to see verse\n"
"number 1, then uncheck this option."
msgstr "Planti taim ol i hait namba bilong namba wan\n"
"ves - moa taim em i kam bihain long bikpela\n"
"namba bilong kapitel (drop-cap). Dispela opsen\n"
"i op pinis. Sapos yu laik lukim ves namba 1,\n"
"anclikim dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:21093
msgid "Keep repeated words together"
msgstr "Putim wantaim ol wed i kam gen"

#: temp.glade:21097
msgid "This option encourages re-duplicated\n"
"words (i.e. those which are intentionally\n"
"repeated) to come together on the same line\n"
"by inserting a NoBreakSpace between them.\n"
"For example, \"gama gama\", or \"kala kala\" \n"
"need to be stuck together (with a NBSP)\n"
"in order to be read meaningfully.\n"
"However, if there are many of these in the\n"
"language, then it may create other unwanted\n"
"typesetting issues. Use with care!"
msgstr "Dispela opsen i helpim ol wed i kam gen\n"
"(i min, ol wed ol i makim long kam gen)\n"
"long i stap wantaim long wanpela lain\n"
"long putim NoBreakSpace namel long ol.\n"
"Pas olsem, \"gama gama\", o \"kala kala\"\n"
"i mas pas wantaim (long NBSP)\n"
"long ol i ken kamap klia long ridim.\n"
"Tasol, sapos planti olsem i stap long\n"
"languis, em i ken mekim ol narapela\n"
"probolem long typesetting. Yusim gut!"

#: temp.glade:21119
msgid "Indent first paragraph after section heading"
msgstr "Indentim namba wan paragraf bihain long hedim bilong sekson"

#: temp.glade:21139
msgid "Use hanging verse number for poetry"
msgstr "Yusim hanging ves namba long poetri"

#: temp.glade:21159
msgid "Prevent verse widow words"
msgstr "Putim stop long ol sotpela wod i stap wanpela tasol long ves"

#: temp.glade:21179
msgid "Prevent orphan words at end of paragraph or start of line."
msgstr "Putim stop long ol wod i stap wanpela tasol long las bilong paragraf o long stat bilong lain."

#: temp.glade:21183
msgid "This option limits short words\n"
"at the ends of paragraphs from \n"
"occuring on a line on their own.\n"
"It also prevents short words at \n"
"the end of sentences from starting \n"
"on a new line."
msgstr "Dispela opsen i putim stop long ol sotpela wod\n"
"long las bilong paragraf i no ken stap\n"
"wanpela tasol long wanpela lain.\n"
"I putim stop tu long ol sotpela wod\n"
"long las bilong sentens i no ken stat\n"
"long nupela lain."

#: temp.glade:21201
msgid "Justify paragraphs"
msgstr "Justifaim ol paragraf"

#: temp.glade:21229
msgid "Enable section headings"
msgstr "Larim ol hedim bilong sekson"

#: temp.glade:21272
msgid "Show Section Headings in Margin"
msgstr "Soim ol hedim bilong sekson long margin"

#: temp.glade:21305
msgid "Enable parallel passage references"
msgstr "Larim ol refrens bilong ol parallel pasis"

#: temp.glade:21309
msgid "Uncheck this option to hide all the\n"
"Parallel Pasage References which\n"
"occur below Section Headings."
msgstr "Rausim mak long dispela opsen long haidim olgeta\n"
"Parallel Pasage Refrens i stap\n"
"aninit long ol hedim bilong sekson."

#: temp.glade:21356
msgid "Show or hide empty verses"
msgstr "Soim o haidim ol ves i no gat tok"

#: temp.glade:21378
msgid "Show elipsis in place of missing verses"
msgstr "Soim ellipsis long ples bilong ol ves i lus"

#: temp.glade:21410
msgid "Show verse numbers in the margin"
msgstr "Soim ol namba bilong ves long margin"

#: temp.glade:21451
msgid "Horizontal position of marginal verses"
msgstr "Ples bilong ol ves long margin (sait i go sait)"

#: temp.glade:21485 temp.glade:21503
msgid "This is the amount of space to the left\n"
"of the column of text to accommodate \n"
"marginal verse numbers. (pts)"
msgstr "Dispela em hamas spes long han kais\n"
"bilong kolum bilong tok, bilong ol namba\n"
"bilong ves long margin. (pts)"

#: temp.glade:21500
msgid "Column width for marginal verses"
msgstr "Bikpela bilong kolum bilong ol ves long margin"

#: temp.glade:21557
msgid "Show chapter numbers"
msgstr "Soim ol namba bilong kapitel"

#: temp.glade:21561
msgid "Uncheck this option to hide all chapter \n"
"numbers - making the publication read\n"
"more like an ordinary book.\n"
"\n"
"Note that there is another option lower down\n"
"in the next section which will only \"Hide Chapter\n"
"Number in Single Chapter Books\"."
msgstr "Rausim mak long dispela opsen long haidim olgeta\n"
"namba bilong kapitel, na buk bai i kamap olsem\n"
"buk nating.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim, i gat narapela opsen i stap daunbilo\n"
"long nekis sekson, em bai \"Haidim Namba bilong Kapitel\n"
"long ol Buk i gat Wanpela Kapitel tasol\"."

#: temp.glade:21612
msgid "Show verse numbers"
msgstr "Soim ol namba bilong ves"

#: temp.glade:21664
msgid "Show or hide scripture text"
msgstr "Soim o haidim tok bilong Skripsa"

#: temp.glade:21719
msgid "Enable special features for some books"
msgstr "Larim ol spesol fisa long sampela buk"

#: temp.glade:21723
msgid "Some Poetical books like the Psalms, and maybe even\n"
"Proverbs look better without drop-cap chapter numbers.\n"
"Instead, they can use a prefix like \"Chapter\" or \"Psalm\"\n"
"at the start of the chapter.\n"
"Note: If the text already has one or more \\cl markers, then\n"
"these settings will overrirde what has been set in the text."
msgstr "Sampela buk bilong poetri olsem Ol Sam, na maski Ol Sampela Tok Piksa\n"
"i luk gutpela moa sapos i no gat bikpela namba bilong kapitel.\n"
"Olsem, ol i ken yusim wanpela prefiks olsem \"Kapitel\" o \"Sam\"\n"
"long stat bilong kapitel.\n"
"Tingim: Sapos tok i gat wanpela o moa \\cl mak pinis, orait\n"
"dispela ol seting bai i win long dispela i stap pinis long tok."

#: temp.glade:21741
msgid "List of books with special features enabled"
msgstr "Lista bilong ol buk i gat spesol fisa"

#: temp.glade:21761
msgid "Chapter label (for special feature books)"
msgstr "Leibel bilong kapitel (bilong ol buk i gat spesol fisa)"

#: temp.glade:21765
msgid "The chapter “label” to be used when rendering\n"
"chapter divisions as headings (instead of drop-cap\n"
"numerals). For example, \"Chapter\" or \"Psalm\".\n"
"\n"
"If you want the chapter number to appear centered\n"
"and above the Section Header WITHOUT any preceding\n"
"text, then just put the code \\\\ZWNBSP in here. This will\n"
"insert a Zero Width Non-Break Space."
msgstr "Leibel bilong kapitel i go long yusim taim ol i makim\n"
"ol kapitel olsem hedim (i no bikpela namba).\n"
"Olsem, \"Kapitel\" o \"Sam\".\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik namba bilong kapitel i kamap long namel\n"
"na antap long Hedim bilong Sekson na i no gat tok bipo,\n"
"orait putim kod \\\\ZWNBSP long hia. Dispela bai\n"
"putim Zero Width Non-Break Space."

#: temp.glade:21785
msgid "The chapter “label” to be used when rendering\n"
"chapter divisions as headings (instead of drop-cap\n"
"numerals). For example, \"Chapter\" or \"Psalm\".\n"
"\n"
"If you want the chapter number to appear centered\n"
"and above the Section Header WITHOUT any preceding\n"
"text, then just put the code \\ZWNBSP in here. This will\n"
"insert a Zero Width Non Break Space."
msgstr "Leibel bilong kapitel i go long yusim taim ol i makim\n"
"ol kapitel olsem hedim (i no bikpela namba).\n"
"Olsem, \"Kapitel\" o \"Sam\".\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik namba bilong kapitel i kamap long namel\n"
"na antap long Hedim bilong Sekson na i no gat tok bipo,\n"
"orait putim kod \\ZWNBSP long hia. Dispela bai\n"
"putim Zero Width Non Break Space."

#: temp.glade:21807
msgid "Enable 1 or 2 column layout for certain books"
msgstr "Larim 1 o 2 kolum long sampela buk"

#: temp.glade:21843
msgid "Trying to get  columns of poetry to balance often\n"
"creates all sorts of unforeseen issues and unwanted\n"
"whitespace. This option allows columns to be \n"
"unbalanced, which might improve the overall look.\n"
"But note that it also allows Widow and Orphan \n"
"lines to occur, which is a negative side-effect."
msgstr "Taim yumi traim stretim ol kolum bilong poetri long i stap wankain, planti taim em i kamapim olkain hevi yumi no bin ting long en na tu planti spes i no gat samting long en. Dispela opsen i larim ol kolum i no stap wankain, na dispela inap mekim pes i luk gut moa.\n"
"Tasol tingim olsem dispela i larim tu ol Widow na Orphan lain i kamap, em i wanpela nogut long dispela."

#: temp.glade:21862
msgid "List of books with different column settings"
msgstr "Lista bilong ol buk i gat narapela seting bilong kolum"

#: temp.glade:21906
msgid "Define how glossary words should appear in the text"
msgstr "Makim olsem wanem ol glosari wod i mas kamap long tekst"

#: temp.glade:21929
msgid "Markup for glossary words in text"
msgstr "Mak bilong ol glosari wod long tekst"

#: temp.glade:21961
msgid "Show chapters in single chapter books"
msgstr "Soim ol kapitel long ol buk i gat wanpela kapitel tasol"

#: temp.glade:21982
msgid "Show chapters in non-scripture books"
msgstr "Soim ol kapitel long ol buk i no Skripsa"

#: temp.glade:22161
msgid "Show footnote callers in notes area"
msgstr "Soim ol footnote caller long ples bilong ol nout"

#: temp.glade:22183
msgid "Reset footnote callers on each page"
msgstr "Stat gen long ol footnote caller long olgeta pes"

#: temp.glade:22215
msgid "Show Footnote Callers in the Text"
msgstr "Soim ol Footnote Caller long Tekst"

#: temp.glade:22250
msgid "Footnote Caller Sequence Entry"
msgstr "Lista bilong ol Footnote Caller"

#: temp.glade:22254 temp.glade:23471
msgid "These callers should automatically be loaded from\n"
"the settings in the Paratext project, but can be\n"
"modified here if needed.\n"
"(Use to button on the right to Reload if needed.)\n"
"\n"
"Separate callers with a comma (no spaces).\n"
"For example: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, etc.\n"
"or:  †,‡,§,∥,#    or: ✶,☆,✦,✪"
msgstr "Ol caller i mas kam otomatik long ol seting bilong Paratext project, tasol yu ken senisim ol hia sapos i gar nid.\n"
"(Yusim boton long skelim i go long raet bilong Reload gen sapos i gat nid.)\n"
"\n"
"Saparetim ol caller long wanpela koma (no gat spes).\n"
"Pasin: a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h, na ol narapela.\n"
"o:  †,‡,§,∥,#    o: ✶,☆,✦,✪"

#: temp.glade:22274
msgid "Reload footnote callers from Paratext"
msgstr "Reload gen ol footnote caller long Paratext"

#: temp.glade:22311
msgid "Override Footnote Settings in Text"
msgstr "Senisim ol Footnote Seting long Tekst"

#: temp.glade:22315
msgid "The Footnotes specified in Paratext use\n"
"\\x +(plus) to cycle through the callers,\n"
"or \\x - (minus) to omit the caller.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is enabled, the Show Callers\n"
"settings below will override whatever\n"
"has been specified within the text itself."
msgstr "Ol Footnote i stap long Paratext i yusim\n"
