msgid "If setting the header for a diglot\n"
"you will need to specify whether\n"
"the Primary (Left) text's formatting\n"
"should be used for this part of the\n"
"header, or the Secondary format.\n"
"\n"
"Note: To activate or change this \n"
"setting, you must first enable Diglot."
msgstr "Sapos yu makim het bilong wanpela diglot,\n"
"yu mas makim sapos fomat bilong Primeri (Left) tekst\n"
"i mas go long dispela hap bilong het,\n"
"o Sekonderi fomat.\n"
"\n"
"Skelim: Bilong stat o senisim \n"
"dispela seting, yu mas opim Diglot pastaim."

#: temp.glade:26515
msgid "Use formatting from secondary project (inner header)"
msgstr "Usim fomat bilong sekonderi projek (het long insait)"

#: temp.glade:26542
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (center header)"
msgstr "Usim fomat bilong primeri projek (het long namel)"

#: temp.glade:26569 temp.glade:26623
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (outer header)"
msgstr "Usim fomat bilong primeri projek (het long autsait)"

#: temp.glade:26596
msgid "Use formatting from secondary project (center header)"
msgstr "Usim fomat bilong sekonderi projek (het long namel)"

#: temp.glade:2664
msgid "Generate front matter: PARATEXT (make a local copy)"
msgstr "Kamapim front matter: PARATEXT (mekim wanpela kopi long kompiuta)"

#: temp.glade:26694
msgid "By default, the chapter number will be included\n"
"in any references in the header line. If you prefer\n"
"to suppress that (and just show the book name)\n"
"then uncheck this option."
msgstr "Olgeta taim, namba bilong kapitel bai stap insait\n"
"long ol rEferens long header line. Sapos yu no laik\n"
"sho dispela (na sho nem bilong buk tasol)\n"
"orait rausim tik long dispela opsen."

#: temp.glade:26911 temp.glade:26937
msgid "If the document you are creating needs\n"
"to be appended to another, you can\n"
"start the page numbering from where\n"
"the previous document ends by entering\n"
"the subsequent page number here.\n"
"\n"
"If you want front matter pages to be numbered \n"
"with roman numerals (i, ii, iii, iv, v, etc) then \n"
"add this line to the front matter to trigger it:\n"
"       \\resetpagenums -1\n"
"and normal page numbering will restart as\n"
"soon as the first scripture book is encountered."
msgstr "Sapos dokumen yu wokim i mas i go bihain\n"
"long narapela dokumen, yu ken stretim namba bilong\n"
"pes long stat long we dokumen bipo i pinis,\n"
"bilong taipim namba bilong pes i kam bihain long hia.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik putim ol namba Rom (i, ii, iii, iv, v, na\n"
"olsem) long ol front matter pes, orait putim dispela\n"
"lain long front matter bilong kirapim:\n"
"       \\resetpagenums -1\n"
"na namba bilong pes bai kirap gen olsem pastaim taim\n"
"buk Skripsa nambawan i kamap."

#: temp.glade:26934
msgid "Start numbering scripture books from page N"
msgstr "Statim namba bilong ol buk Skripsa long pes N"

#: temp.glade:26970
msgid "Print page number at each book's Intro page footer"
msgstr "Printim namba bilong pes long footer bilong Intro pes bilong olgeta buk"

#: temp.glade:26974
msgid "By default there is no page number on the\n"
"Title Page of each book. Check this option\n"
"to place the page number at the bottom of\n"
"the page (only on Intoductory Pages before \n"
"the scripture text begins)."
msgstr "Olgeta taim, i no gat namba bilong pes long\n"
"Title Page bilong olgeta buk. Makim dispela opsen\n"
"bilong putim namba bilong pes long as bilong\n"
"pes (long ol Intro Pes tasol, ol pes bipo long\n"
"text bilong Skripsa i kirap)."

#: temp.glade:26992
msgid "Print the name of the config on Intro pages' footer"
msgstr "Printim nem bilong config long footer bilong ol Intro pes"

#: temp.glade:26996
msgid "It may be helpful to print the Name of\n"
"the Saved Configuration on the first\n"
"page (of every book) as a reminder for\n"
"later - as to which settings were used\n"
"to produce the PDF."
msgstr "Maski i gutpela long printim Nem bilong\n"
"Saved Configuration long namba wan\n"
"pes (bilong olgeta buk) bilong tingting\n"
"bek bihain - ol seting husat ol i yusim\n"
"bilong wokim PDF."

#: temp.glade:27059
msgid "Center page footer settings"
msgstr "Seting bilong footer long namel bilong pes"

#: temp.glade:27063
msgid "It is not considered best-practice to include \n"
"information in a footer for scripture publications.\n"
"This is usually better placed in the header. However,\n"
"if there is a need to have the page number at the\n"
"footer for all pages (not just the 1st page of each book)\n"
"then that can be set here. Similarly, you may want to add\n"
"a DRAFT message and/or date to the end of each page.\n"
"Note that you can select a preset option OR type your own\n"
"text as needed.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"[\\pagenumber]   places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins   would give \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-YY HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"Note that if you really must have Inner/Outer Footers,\n"
"these can be set in the ptxprint-mods.tex file."
msgstr "Ol i no ting i gutpela long putim\n"
"infomesen long footer bilong ol buk Skripsa.\n"
"Olgeta taim i gutpela long putim long header. Tasol,\n"
"sapos yu laik putim namba bilong pes long\n"
"footer bilong olgeta pes (i no namba wan pes bilong buk tasol)\n"
"orait yu ken seting long hia. Na tu, yu ken putim\n"
"DRAFT o de long as bilong olgeta pes.\n"
"Yu ken makim wanpela preset o taipim tok bilong yu yet.\n"
"\n"
"Pastaim:\n"
"[\\pagenumber]   i putim square brackets raun long namba bilong pes\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins   i givim \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-YY HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     i no putim wanpela samting long dispela ples\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu really mas gat Inner/Outer Footers,\n"
"yu ken seting long fail ptxprint-mods.tex."

#: temp.glade:27138
msgid "Use formatting from secondary project (center footer)"
msgstr "Yusim format bilong namba tu project (footer long namel)"

#: temp.glade:27142 temp.glade:27167
msgid "If setting the footer for a diglot\n"
"you will need to specify whether\n"
"the Primary (Left) text's formatting\n"
"should be used for this part of the\n"
"header, or the Secondary format."
msgstr "Sapos yu seting footer bilong diglot,\n"
"yu mas tokim PTXprint sapos format\n"
"bilong Primary (Left) text i mas stap\n"
"long dispela hap bilong header,\n"
"o format bilong Secondary."

#: temp.glade:27163
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (center footer)"
msgstr "Yusim format bilong namba wan project (footer long namel)"

#: temp.glade:27486
