#: temp.glade:27882
msgid "Use high-resolution pictures"
msgstr "Yusim ol piksa i gat high-resolution"

#: temp.glade:27886
msgid "If this option is selected, it will first search \n"
"for PDFs, then PNGs, and finally JPGs.\n"
"\n"
"The original higher-quality illustrations are\n"
"usually larger (.TIF .PNG or .PDF files) and \n"
"are stored in the local\\Figures folder so that\n"
"they are not shared via Send/Recv. If these are\n"
"used, the resulting PDF could be very large, and\n"
"therefore difficult to share electronically, but\n"
"the image quality will be as good as possible."
msgstr "Sapos yu makim dispela opsen, program bai painim PDF pastaim, na bihain PNG, na las JPG.\n"
"\n"
"Ol orijinal piksa i gat gutpela kwaliti i save bikpela moa (.TIF .PNG o .PDF fail) na i stap long local\\Figures folder, olsem na ol i no go long Send/Recv. Sapos yu yusim ol dispela, PDF i kamap bai i ken bikpela tumas, na hat long salim long kompyuta, tasol kwaliti bilong piksa bai i gutpela olgeta."

#: temp.glade:27911
msgid "Use low-resolution pictures"
msgstr "Yusim ol piksa i gat liklik resolusen"

#: temp.glade:27936
msgid "Pictures: Only show empty place-holders"
msgstr "Piksa: Soim ol empti ples tasol"

#: temp.glade:28071
msgid "Omit Missing Pictures"
msgstr "Lusim ol Piksa i Lus"

#: temp.glade:28109
msgid "Pictures: Remove Image Borders"
msgstr "Piksa: Rausim ol Border bilong Piksa"

#: temp.glade:28137
msgid "Request Access to High Quality Illustrations/Maps\n"
"in the SIL repository.\n"
"\n"
"Click this button to fill in the form requesting access\n"
"to the illustrations used in the current publication.\n"
"\n"
"After completing and sumitting the online form\n"
"you should receive an immediate response by email\n"
"with a link to download the illustrations (if approved)."
msgstr "Askim Rot long Kisim ol Gutpela Kwaliti Piksa/Map\n"
"long SIL repository.\n"
"\n"
"Klikim dispela boton long pulapim fom bilong askim rot long kisim ol piksa ol i yusim long dispela publikesen.\n"
"\n"
"Bihain long yu pulapim na salim fom long intanet, yu ken kisim wantaim ansa long email wantaim link long daunlodim ol piksa (sapos ol i orait)."

#: temp.glade:28195
msgid "Use pictures from a particular folder"
msgstr "Yusim ol piksa long wanpela folder"

#: temp.glade:28199
msgid "The following locations are scanned for pictures:\n"
"  My Paratext ... Projects\\<prjID>\\figures\n"
"  My Paratext ... Projects\\<prjID>\\local\\figures\n"
"  Users\\...\\AppData\\Local\\SIL\\ptxprint\\imagesets\n"
"\n"
"If your pictures are in a different folder, then enable\n"
"this option and select a Picture Folder to be scanned\n"
"in addition to the folders listed above. Note that ALL\n"
"subfolders also getted scanned unless you explicity\n"
"enable the 'Exclude Subfolders' option."
msgstr "Ol dispela ples i save kisim ol piksa:\n"
"  My Paratext ... Projects\\<prjID>\\figures\n"
"  My Paratext ... Projects\\<prjID>\\local\\figures\n"
"  Users\\...\\AppData\\Local\\SIL\\ptxprint\\imagesets\n"
"\n"
"Sapos ol piksa bilong yu i stap long narapela folder, makim dispela opsen na makim wanpela Picture Folder bilong painim ol piksa long en, wantaim ol folder i stap antap. Tingim ol sabfolder OLGETA tu i save kisim, sapos yu no makim 'Exclude Subfolders' opsen."

#: temp.glade:28223
msgid "Select the folder which contains pictures"
msgstr "Makim folder i gat ol piksa"

#: temp.glade:28264
msgid "Pictures: Exclusively Use Selected Folder"
msgstr "Piksa: Yusim Folder Yu Makim Tasol"

#: temp.glade:2830
msgid "Generate PicList: Append to existing list"
msgstr "Kamapim PicList: Putim long lista i stap pinis"

#: temp.glade:28328
msgid "Pictures: Preferred image types"
msgstr "Piksa: Ol kain piksa yu laikim"

#: temp.glade:28380
msgid "This setting enables/disables all the \n"
"other settings relating to pictures.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it is important to provide proper \n"
"copyright attribution for the illustrations \n"
"used in a publication, and this can be done\n"
"very easily using the \\zimagecopyrights\n"
"magic code within the Colophon (see\n"
"the Header+Footer tab for details).\n"
msgstr "Dispela seting i opim o pasim olgeta narapela seting bilong ol piksa.\n"
"\n"
"Tingim olsem em i bikpela samting long putim stretpela kopirait bilong ol piksa ol i yusim long wanpela buk. Yu ken mekim dispela isi tru long yusim \\zimagecopyrights magic kod insait long Colophon (lukim Header+Footer tab long kisim moa save).\n"

#: temp.glade:28511
msgid "Picture: Anchor reference"
msgstr "Piksa: Anchor refrens"

#: temp.glade:2853
msgid "Generate PicList: Replace existing list"
msgstr "Kamapim PicList: Senisim lista i stap pinis"

#: temp.glade:28542
msgid "By default the caption will appear below the picture.\n"
"If you need the caption to come before the picture\n"
"then add this line to your ptxprint-mods.tex file:\n"
"   \\CaptionFirsttrue"
msgstr "Olgeta taim, caption i kam aninit long piksa. Sapos yu laik caption i kam bipo long piksa, putim dispela lain long ptxprint-mods.tex fail bilong yu:\n"
"   \\CaptionFirsttrue"

#: temp.glade:28558
msgid "By default, the caption will be followed by a Ch:Vs\n"
"reference in parentheses ( ). \n"
"\n"
"If you need the Caption Ref to come BEFORE the caption\n"
"text then add this line to your ptxprint-mods.tex file:\n"
"   \\CaptionRefFirsttrue\n"
"\n"
"To prevent Caption Refs from appearing globally,\n"
"use Pictures > Settings tab option:\n"
"    'Omit References (ch:vs) From Caption'"
msgstr "Olgeta taim, Ch:Vs refrens insait long ol kakaruk ( ) i kam bihain long caption.\n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu laik Caption Ref i kam BIPO long caption tekst, putim dispela lain long ptxprint-mods.tex fail bilong yu:\n"
"   \\CaptionRefFirsttrue\n"
"\n"
"Long rausim Caption Ref long olgeta ples, yusim opsen bilong Pictures > Settings tab:\n"
"    'Omit References (ch:vs) From Caption'"

