#: temp.glade:2900
msgid "By default all illustrations are place in the top-left\n"
"corner of a page (when double columns are used)\n"
"and at the top in single column mode. \n"
"\n"
"Checking this option will randomly position the\n"
"illustrations on the page (using top-left, top-right\n"
"bottom-left and bottom-right). \n"
"\n"
"You can change the location of pictures later if needed."
msgstr "Olgeta taim, olgeta piksa i save stap long top-left\n"
"kona bilong pes (taim yu usim tupela kolum)\n"
"na long antap taim i wanpela kolum tasol. \n"
"\n"
"Sapos yu makim dispela opsen, ol piksa bai i go long\n"
"ples i no stret long pes (top-left, top-right,\n"
"bottom-left na bottom-right). \n"
"\n"
"Yu ken senisim ples bilong ol piksa bihain sapos yu laik."

