msgid "Picture: Credit overlay options"
msgstr "Piksa: Ol opsen bilong credit overlay"

#: temp.glade:29160
msgid "Picture: Credit overlay position and style"
msgstr "Piksa: Ples na stail bilong credit overlay"

#: temp.glade:29235
msgid "One or more optional (x-xetex) attributes \n"
"can be applied for rotation and/or PDF page\n"
"selection. For example:\n"
"rotated 90     - anti-clockwise\n"
"rotate=edge     - top to outside edge\n"
"rotate=binding    - top to binding edge\n"
"page=2     - select page 2 of multipage PDF\n"
"\n"
"Mulitple parameters should be space-separated:\n"
"rotate=binding page=2"
msgstr "Yu ken putim wanpela o moa (x-xetex) atribut i no mas\n"
"long rotation na/o long makim pes bilong PDF.\n"
"Samting olsem:\n"
"rotated 90     - i go anti-clockwise\n"
"rotate=edge     - antap i go long arere i stap autsait\n"
"rotate=binding    - antap i go long arere bilong binding\n"
"page=2     - makim pes 2 bilong PDF i gat planti pes\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat planti parameter, putim spes namel long ol:\n"
"rotate=binding page=2"

#: temp.glade:29256
msgid "Picture: Additional attributes"
msgstr "Piksa: Ol narapela atribut"

#: temp.glade:29260
msgid "One or more optional (x-xetex) attributes \n"
"can be applied for rotation and/or PDF page\n"
"selection. For example:\n"
"rotated 90     - anti-clockwise\n"
"rotate=edge     - top to outside edge\n"
"rotate=binding    - top to binding edge\n"
"page=2     - select page 2 of multi-page PDF\n"
"\n"
"Mulitple parameters should be space-separated:\n"
"rotate=binding page=2"
msgstr "Yu ken putim wanpela o moa (x-xetex) atribut i no mas\n"
"long rotation na/o long makim pes bilong PDF.\n"
"Samting olsem:\n"
"rotated 90     - i go anti-clockwise\n"
"rotate=edge     - antap i go long arere i stap autsait\n"
"rotate=binding    - antap i go long arere bilong binding\n"
"page=2     - makim pes 2 bilong PDF i gat planti pes\n"
"\n"
"Sapos i gat planti parameter, putim spes namel long ol:\n"
"rotate=binding page=2"

#: temp.glade:2937
msgid "Generate PicList: Protect existing PicList settings"
msgstr "Kamapim PicList: Lukautim ol seting bilong PicList i stap pinis"

#: temp.glade:2941
msgid "When synchronizing the pictures from the\n"
"Paratext files with PTXprint's PicList, don't\n"
"change any of the (layout and size) settings\n"
"and don't delete any pictures no longer found\n"
"in the Paratext USFM text.\n"
"\n"
"[In future...]\n"
"This option may highlight which pictures are\n"
"new, and which have been deleted, but will\n"
"not remove them from the PicList for you."
msgstr "Taim yu mekim ol piksa long ol fail bilong Paratext i stret wantaim PicList bilong PTXprint, no senisim wanpela seting (layout na saiz) na no rausim ol piksa i no stap moa long USFM tekst bilong Paratext.\n"
"\n"
"[Long bihain...]\n"
"Dispela opsen inap soim ol piksa i nupela na ol i rausim pinis, tasol i no ken rausim ol long PicList bilong yu."

