"\n"
"NOTE: The colophon will not appear \n"
"the first time you run it, but will appear\n"
"on subsequent runs."
msgstr "Wanem samting em Colophon?\n"
"Wanpela sotpela tok i gat infomesen bilong publikesen, olsem ples bilong printim, publisa, na de bilong printim. Bai i kamap long PINIS bilong buk. I wankain olsem \"biblio-page\" o \"copyright-page\" long stat bilong buk.\n"
"\n"
"TINGTING: Colophon i no inap kamap long namba wan taim yu ranim, tasol bai i kamap long ol narapela ran bihain."

